    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382790/extras/4ccc06af8effcb6138c5f3da232ec20b.webp?t=1744092409\" width=200 height=24 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CAUTION: This game is a blend of a visual novel and puzzle game.<br><br>ABOUT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Dissolving Disarray</i> is an RPG Maker adventure horror game.<br>Awaken as a girl lost in a vine-clad room with no recollection of her past. Imprisoned within an otherworldly tower, she must piece together the fragments of her forgotten life and escape before succumbing to the tower's maddening absurdity.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intuitive puzzles inspired by RPG Maker classics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings: Bad, Good, and True.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player choices that affect the story's outcome.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn and pixel art.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made by a solo-developer with a few playtesters.<br>  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382790/extras/4ccc06af8effcb6138c5f3da232ec20b.webp?t=1744092409\" width=200 height=24 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382790/extras/4ccc06af8effcb6138c5f3da232ec20b.webp?t=1744092409\" width=200 height=24 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CAUTION: This game is a blend of a visual novel and puzzle game.<br><br>ABOUT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Dissolving Disarray</i> is an RPG Maker adventure horror game.<br>Awaken as a girl lost in a vine-clad room with no recollection of her past. Imprisoned within an otherworldly tower, she must piece together the fragments of her forgotten life and escape before succumbing to the tower's maddening absurdity.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intuitive puzzles inspired by RPG Maker classics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings: Bad, Good, and True.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player choices that affect the story's outcome.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn and pixel art.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made by a solo-developer with a few playtesters.<br>  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382790/extras/4ccc06af8effcb6138c5f3da232ec20b.webp?t=1744092409\" width=200 height=24 /></span></p>",
